 " into it."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->275,ExpressionUUID->"5bd96bba-f764-4406-ae70-7fe5037a61b1"],

Cell["\<\
Instantiate[sol] clears sol, sets it to an association over the 18 object \
types, and installs the UpValues of Load, Unload, IncludeTo, DropFrom and \
MergeWith on it.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->276,ExpressionUUID->"b682b712-df3b-4f97-9456-e6d66349dc26"],

Cell["\<\
A bare association, such as one returned by GetData, carries no UpValues and \
is inert. Load[sol] installs them; Instantiate is the way to start from \
nothing instead.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->277,ExpressionUUID->"86a9d35b-52f8-4dce-8aeb-cc3ed84d77e8"],

Cell["\<\
Instantiate[sol, assoc] instantiates and then merges assoc in, which is \
equivalent to Instantiate followed by MergeWith.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->278,ExpressionUUID->"579a0d1f-7927-449d-bf7e-2821c23446b4"],

Cell["Instantiate has the attribute HoldFirst.", "Notes",
 CellID->279,ExpressionUUID->"a87b25b0-0399-456a-a32b-681f80babf5e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection",
 CellTags->"PrimaryExamplesSection",
 CellID->280,ExpressionUUID->"be24b171-9727-4b55-a786-095c017fc02f"],

Cell["Basic Examples", "ExampleSection",
 CellID->281,ExpressionUUID->"e18c60e9-7a66-4830-8fa1-057d25bdf4fe"],

Cell["\<\
Before Instantiate, sol is an ordinary symbol: it has no value, and nothing \
is attached to it.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->282,ExpressionUUID->"a8f9cc4d-7070-4e13-a2f3-cc157ac485b8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "sol", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"UpValues", "[", "sol", "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->283,ExpressionUUID->"355c086e-c390-416f-aacf-f97350ac510f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"False", ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->284,ExpressionUUID->"18de0d87-c977-478c-9c9f-42ca02a8a488"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Instantiate makes it a solution. It returns nothing; the effect is on sol \
itself.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->285,ExpressionUUID->"19ee573b-deab-44e5-896c-22e55be443e5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Instantiate", "[", "sol", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->286,ExpressionUUID->"62c42779-96b8-42e9-a14b-175ac0db7f10"],

Cell["\<\
sol is now an association keyed by the eighteen object types, every one of \
them still empty. This is the container that IncludeTo fills.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->287,ExpressionUUID->"dd900fcf-8bb9-4916-9883-b95cb5e81a3f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData["sol"], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->288,ExpressionUUID->"3bbdd19f-3628-4fd9-b7c5-009994542c47"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"$manifold", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$parameter", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$metric", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$frame", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$spinStructure", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$spinConnection", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$bundle", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$covd", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$chart", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$basis", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$form", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$tensor", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$spinor", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$function", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$constant", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$assumption", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$rule", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$set", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->289,ExpressionUUID->"02cd5bb3-8a55-4928-9365-eae1f65fa867"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
It has also acquired UpValues, so the solution functions now act on it \
directly. These are the functions hooked onto sol:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->290,ExpressionUUID->"d0dfcc57-702f-466c-a60e-24ec07608b80"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Union", "@", 
  RowBox[{"Cases", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"UpValues", "[", "sol", "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Verbatim", "[", "HoldPattern", "]"}], "[", 
      RowBox[{"f_Symbol", "[", "___", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", "f"}], 
    ",", " ", "Infinity"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->291,ExpressionUUID->"ae6a9218-d2f3-4c0d-b1bd-e45f51b052d6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
  "DropFrom", ",", "IncludeTo", ",", "Load", ",", "MergeWith", ",", 
   "Unload"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->292,ExpressionUUID->"9e53ddf6-0270-4319-95a9-4ac0a36bc764"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Eleven UpValue patterns implement those five functions -- one per argument \
form each accepts.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->293,ExpressionUUID->"aee34acd-4d4c-45a5-b72e-69278dbac2c7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
  RowBox[{"UpValues", "[", "sol", "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->294,ExpressionUUID->"14c9b62a-e80e-4a16-879c-bb93da5f31bf"],

Cell[BoxData["11"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->295,ExpressionUUID->"aad5b36f-03e5-4065-a824-6f90ba1f0b17"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

